### Page 3 of 11

```text
2

NOW, THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, THAT the application submitted by the Applicant to BOPU for
sanitary sewer services and water services outside of the corporate limits of the City of Cheyenne
for the property more specifically described above, is hereby approved, with the following
conditions: 1. the proposed development shall comply with City Standards, or applicable City
relief processes; and, 2. the property owner initiates annexation pursuant to Wyo. Stat. § 15-1-403
within one hundred and eighty (180) days of approval of this resolution.

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that BOPU and the Applicant are authorized to approve
and execute Outside User Agreement(s), subject to the condition(s) imposed by the Governing
Body.

PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this _______ day of _____________________,
2024.

__________________________________________
Patrick Collins, Mayor

